2 CONT
2 CONT     * BIRTH: ABT 1600, Dundee, Skottland
2 CONT
2 CONT     * BAPTISM: (Peter Don Dass)
2 CONT
2 CONT     * DEATH: 1653, Nord Herøy, Helgeland, Nordland 
