2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Ingeborg-Cathrine-Holtermann/5662301538050026188 Ingeborg Cathrine Hagerup] - døpte 28 Jun 1730 - Trondhjem
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Christian-Frederik-Hagerup/6000000005441211167 Christian Frederik Hagerup] - 31 Jul 1731 - Trondhjem
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Christine-Margrethe-Falch/6000000004096802557 Christiane Margrethe Hagerup] - døpte 8 Nov 1732, Trondhjem
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Peder-Hagerup/6000000021137484423 Peder Hagerup] - døpte 16 Jan 1734 - Trondhjem
