2 CONT Dieuwertje Willems married [https://www.geni.com/profile-11578188293 Dirck Govertsz 't Hoen van Souburgh]. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-11577873293 Willem Dircx Thoen Van Souburch]; [http
2 CONC s://www.geni.com/profile-10010964293 Aeltgen Dircksdr 't Hoen van Souburgh]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34682135195 Dirck Dircksz Hoens van Souburgh]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34633585277 Lijsbeth Dirck Govertszoonsdr Soub
2 CONC urgh]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died circa 1529. 
2 CONT ----
