1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Ellen Christensdatter Jyde''' was born on August 10, 1587 in Denmark. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-16135678 Christen Jensen Jyde] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-16135771 Ane Hansdatter Grisbæk]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ellen married [https://www.geni.com/profile-6072070 Caspar Christophersen Schøller] on January 11, 1607. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * 1607 [https://www.geni.com/profile-81638724 Karen Caspersdatter (Schøller) Hjort];
2 CONT * 1609 [https://www.geni.com/profile-81638637 Christen Caspersen Schøller];
2 CONT * 1611 [https://www.geni.com/profile-81638723 Iver Caspersen Schjøller];
2 CONT * 1613 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34642234825 Hans (Schjøller) Schøller];
2 CONT * 1615 [https://www.geni.com/profile-76814905 Anne Casparsdatter (Schoeller) Mechlenborg];
2 CONT * 1617 [https://www.geni.com/profile-81637656 Helleborg (Schøller) Hjort];
2 CONT * 1619 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34642234957 Caspar Caspersen Schøller];
2 CONT * 1620 twin [https://www.geni.com/profile-34642234976 Maren Caspersdatter Schøller];
2 CONT * 1620 twin [https://www.geni.com/profile-34711924241 Karen Caspersdatter (Scholler) Hjort];
2 CONT * 1622 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34642235000 Anders Caspersen Schøller];
2 CONT * 1628 [https://www.geni.com/profile-6071918 Eiler Caspersen Schøller];
2 CONT * 1630 [https://www.geni.com/profile-33900262 Christoffer Caspersen Schøller, til Gjølme]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on July 6, 1657 in Trondheim, Denmark and was buried in 1657 in Trondheim, Sør-Trøndelag, Norway. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Ellen Christensdatter Jyde'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Gift 11 jan.1607, Trondheim, med Caspar Christophersen Schøller, som överlevde henne. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT You will find "Ellen Christensdatter Jyde" (1587-1657) as married to "Caspar Chrisophersen Schøller" (1582-1661), mayor or Trondheim Norway, in the pedigree chart here (a secondary source data) : http://www.roskildehistorie.dk/sta
2 CONC mtavler/adel/Gruner/Schoeller.htm
