1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Etne-soga by Ståle Dyrvik, vol II Bygde- og gardssoge 1660-1800 page 362 Norheim (1d), Bygdebok for Ølen III page 21 Øvre Hauge, Etnesoga II page 589 Høyland (1).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Not the same as Anna Tolleivsdtr. Ve (Etnesoga II page 690 (1)), that is her younger sister.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT This Anna was the second youngest of her sisters. She had a daughter Lisbet who was named after Anna's mother, priest's daughter Lisbet Nilsdtr. Bugge.
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna's son Nils Tjerandson Øvernes co-signed a sale of inheritance in April 1698 after Anna's half-brother Bjørn Tolleivson Helgeland, Sandeid, who had no children. See page 117 in the Rotvoll family by Per Ivar Rotvoll Tautra pub
2 CONC lished in 2000.
2 CONT
2 CONT 675. Anna Tolleivsdotter d.e. daughter of Tolleiv Bjørnson and Lisbet Nilsdotter, was born circa 1607 in Norheim, Etne, Hordaland, NOR and died before 1655 in Høyland, Etne, Hordaland, NOR. Anna married Tjerand Toreson circa 1626 
2 CONC in Grindheim church, Etne, Hordaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Tolleivsdatter NORHEIM
2 CONT
2 CONT BORN: Before her sister Anna (1c) with the same name, Norheim, Etne, HO
2 CONT
2 CONT DEATH: Approx. 1652
2 CONT
2 CONT Etne Soga II Ståle Dyvik 1972
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Tolleiv Bjørnson NORHEIM
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Lisbet Nielsdatter BUGGE
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 1: Tjerand Torson FOSSA''''''
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Etne-soga by Ståle Dyrvik, vol II Bygde- og gardssoge 1660-1800 page 362 Norheim (1c), page 485 Ve, Etnesoga II page 690 Ve (1).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Not the same as Anna Tolleivsdtr. Hauge Høyland (Bygdebok for Ølen III page 21 Øvre Hauge, Etnesoga II page 589 Høyland (1)), that is her older sister.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT This Anna was the youngest of her sisters. She had a daughter Lisbet who was named after Anna's mother, priest's daughter Lisbet Nilsdtr. Bug.
2 CONT
2 CONT Tolleiv Tørresson Haugland co-signed a sale of inheritance in April 1698 for Anna's half-brother Bjørn Tolleivson Helgeland, Sandeid, who had no children. See page 117 in the Rotvoll family by Per Ivar Rotvoll Tautra published in 
2 CONC 2000.
2 CONT
2 CONT GEDCOM Note
2 CONT Married to Tørris Sjursen Ve. They lived at Ve, Etne, Hordaland. (Ethnesoga 2: Bygde- og gardssoge 1660-1800. p. 690.)
2 CONT Tørris died in 1645. After this, Anna ran the farm as a widow. (Etnesoga 2: Bygde- og gardssoge 1660-1800. p. 690.) (Etnesoga 1: From the oldest times to 1660. p. 485.)''''''
