1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Joachim Henrichsen Jürgens "Jochum von Westerwik" was born on 19 May 1611 at Itzehoe, Schleswig-Holstein, Tyskland. He was the son of Henrich Jürgens and Chatarina Früchtnichts. Joachim Henrichsen Jürgens "Jochum v
2 CONC on Westerwik" was kammertjener "baron Irgens von Westervick" hos kong Christian 4de først. Deretter også for Fredrik 3de.
2 CONT
2 CONT  He married Cornelia de Bickers on 10 December 1656 at Amsterdam, Noord-Holland, Nederland; Oude kerk. Han er nå 45 mens hun er 27 år gammel.  De skal ha hatt fjorten barn, bl.a.: '''Andreas Irgens Vestervig, f.1663 i Amsterdam, d
2 CONC .1665 på Røros''', Henrik Irgens Vestervig, Frederik Christian Irgens Vestervig, Gerhard Bickers Vestervig. Joachim Henrichsen Jürgens "Jochum von Westerwik" died on 29 August 1675 at København, Sjælland, Danmark, at age 64. He wa
2 CONC s buried in September 1675 at Vestervig, Jylland, Danmark; - '''http://home.online.no/~zinow/p67.htm'''
